{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Birdoo is an indie action game were you take control of a bird on his quest for revenge against the humans that mistreated him.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You fight in contained levels aiming to destroy as many enemies as you can within the levels time limit, earning points to progress to the next stage and purchase power ups.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">For too long have you been mistreated by the humans, called a flying rat and shooed away. It's time to take revenge!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle Your Way Through 12 Stages Where Unique Challenges Await You,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect Power Ups to Help You Exact Your Revenge,\u00a0</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn Points and Level Up Your Bird,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Battle a Variety of Unique Enemies,</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Earn the Highest Score With  Leaderboards,</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Show the humans you're no flying rat!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488620?t=1751411913","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3488620?t=1751411913","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/d16712e886a84d18be3181eca3ea7d986c2d3fb7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751411913","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3488620/d16712e886a84d18be3181eca3ea7d986c2d3fb7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751411913","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharin